# Large / private data (folder structure is recreated per machine)
# The repo uses Data/ (capital D); case-insensitive filesystems hide the
# mismatch, so list both variants — otherwise raw/interim data is NOT ignored
# on case-sensitive systems (e.g. Linux CI). Note: Data/processed/ is kept
# intentionally (the app loads those parquet/model artefacts at runtime).
data/raw/
data/interim/
Data/raw/
Data/interim/
Data/external/


